      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "POKE SALAD ANNIE (8) hit the ground running with a slick early sectional but ran over late and missed the frame when a 3.5 lengths fourth (29.72) over 512m at this track. Has a very good strike-rate from this draw, with two wins from three starts. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. SAINT BREE (1) was big odds last time but gave a huge sight after a fast early split, grabbed late but holding on to a placing when a 9 length third (18.04) over 305m at this track. Good beginner assisted by the inside draw. Will give a great sight again. MINNIE'S MY MUM (5) was a strong winner (17.83) from box 7 last time, scoring by 4 lengths at this track. Has the squeeze box to overcome and will need the breaks early. The form from her last run is stacking up nicely. Should feature again. HARRY CHANA (2) can sneak into the finish again.",
